          {
            "description": "The front door's handshake: answers `{\"running\": bool}` once moa's terminal server is\nlinked and has its `moa` session, or when there is no server. `tmux` is the\nabsolute path of the tmux program the front door found.",
            "properties": {
              "method": {
                "const": "tmux.ensure",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "params": {
                "properties": {
                  "tmux": {
                    "default": null,
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "method",
              "params"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          },
          {
            "description": "A panel says which it is: the tab `pane` (`%N`) it draws in, if any, and the `view`\nit shows, and whether moa `placed` it (it runs with `MOA_NO_AUTOSTART`). The view moa\ntagged the tab with wins over the one asked for; without either it gets the one this\npane last had, else the picture. Answers `{key, view, managed}`: `managed` when the\nview is moa's. `once`: a popup (`moa panel … --once`), which tmux ends when its\nprogram does.",
            "properties": {
              "method": {
                "const": "ui.panel",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "params": {
                "properties": {
                  "once": {
                    "default": false,
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "pane": {
                    "default": null,
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "placed": {
                    "default": false,
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "view": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "#/$defs/View"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "default": null
                  }
                },
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "method",
              "params"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          },
